# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# IDE and tools
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Build artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/publish
**/out
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log

# Tests and their results are not part of the image
tests/
**/TestResults
**/*.trx
**/coverage
**/coveragereport

# Documentation
README.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/

# CI/CD
.github/

# Docker's own files, and secrets: .env holds the JWT key and must never land in an image
**/.env
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
configurations/

# The image's SDK tag picks the SDK; global.json would pin one the image may not have
global.json

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
